-size:1rem!important}.c3ph-card strong{font-size:1rem!important}ul[role=list] li span[style*="font-size:.9rem"]{font-size:1rem!important}section#c3-photo{padding-top:0}section:has(+section#c3-photo){background:var(--ivory-2)!important;padding-bottom:2rem}.c3ph-hero{margin:0}.c3-aerial .c3ph-hero{max-width:900px;margin:1.4rem 0 1.6rem}.c3-aerial .c3ph-hero img{aspect-ratio:auto!important;height:auto}.c3-aerial-close .c3ph-hero{max-width:640px}.c3-aerial-ctop .c3ph-cr{top:0;bottom:auto;padding:.35rem .6rem 1.6rem 2.6rem;background:radial-gradient(farthest-side at 100% 0%,rgba(28,32,40,.72),rgba(28,32,40,.4) 55%,rgba(28,32,40,0))}@media (max-width:699px){.c3ph-cards>:last-child:nth-child(odd){grid-column:1/-1}}.c3-maps{display:grid;gap:0 1.5rem;max-width:1136px}@media (min-width:900px){.c3-maps{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;align-items:start}}.c3-maps figure{max-width:none!important;margin:1.4rem 0 .4rem!important}.c3-maps svg,.c3-maps img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto}.c3-map-links{row-gap:0!important}.c3-map-links a{padding:.55rem 0}ul[role=list][style*="minmax(13rem,1fr)"]{grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(min(13rem,100%),1fr))!important}</style><style>.c3-aerial .c3ph-hero,.c3-aerial-close .c3ph-hero{max-width:760px}</style><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Pick a typical condo, or a town and a size, and put in the listing's own price and HOA fee. The calculator fills in what Airbnbs of that size there charge and book on average, from AirROI, a company that publishes Airbnb data town by town. It takes off each cost and gives a rough yearly figure, not a forecast for one condo.</p><div class="st-calc" role="group" aria-labelledby="stCalcT"><p class="t" id="stCalcT">Your rental, before any loan</p><div class="st-pick" role="group" aria-label="Start from a typical condo"><span>Start from a typical condo:</span><button type="button" data-t="garden-city-beach" aria-pressed="true">Garden City Beach</button><button type="button" data-t="surfside-beach" aria-pressed="false">Surfside Beach</button><button type="button" data-t="myrtle-beach" aria-pressed="false">Myrtle Beach oceanfront</button><button type="button" data-t="north-myrtle-beach" aria-pressed="false">North Myrtle Beach oceanfront</button></div><div class="st-pick st-who" role="group" aria-label="Who runs it"><span>Who runs it:</span><button type="button" data-m="0" aria-pressed="true">You</button><button type="button" data-m="15" aria-pressed="false">A manager at 15%</button></div><div class="cols"><div><label for="stTown">Town<select id="stTown"><option value="north-myrtle-beach">North Myrtle Beach</option><option value="myrtle-beach">Myrtle Beach</option><option value="surfside-beach">Surfside Beach</option><option value="garden-city-beach" selected>Garden City Beach</option><option value="murrells-inlet">Murrells Inlet</option><option value="pawleys-island">Pawleys Island</option><option value="little-river">Little River</option><option value="conway">Conway</option></select></label><label for="stBeds">Bedrooms<select id="stBeds"><option value="2" selected>2</option><option value="3">3</option></select></label><p class="st-note" id="stFill" aria-live="polite"></p><label for="stPrice">Price, $<input id="stPrice" type="number" min="0" step="1000" value="343500" inputmode="decimal"></label><label for="stFee">HOA fee a month, $<input id="stFee" type="number" min="0" step="25" value="575" inputmode="decimal"></label><label for="stNightly">Nightly rate, $<input id="stNightly" type="number" min="0" step="1" value="243" inputmode="decimal"></label><label for="stNights">Nights booked a year<input id="stNights" type="number" min="0" step="1" value="95" inputmode="decimal" max="365"></label><div class="row"><span><label for="stTax">Property tax a year, $</label><button type="button" class="q" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="stTaxQ" aria-label="What the property tax means">?</button></span><input id="stTax" type="number" min="0" step="1" value="4272" inputmode="decimal"></div><p class="tip" id="stTaxQ">The county taxes a rental you do not live in on 6 percent of its value, at the tax rate for its address. On the Garden City Beach condo that is about $4,300 a year, about 1.2 percent of the price. The calculator fills it in from the price where we know the rate.</p><label for="stIns">Rental insurance and permit a year, $<input id="stIns" type="number" min="0" step="10" value="620" inputmode="decimal"></label><label for="stMgr">Manager, % of nightly bookings<input id="stMgr" type="number" min="0" step="0.5" value="0" inputmode="decimal" max="100"></label><label class="ck" for="stUtil"><input id="stUtil" type="checkbox"><span>The HOA fee pays the electric and internet</span></label></div><div class="out" aria-live="polite"><div class="ln"><span>Guests pay, with cleaning fees</span><strong id="stGross">$26,843</strong></div><div class="ln"><span>Cleaner, paid by the cleaning fee</span><strong id="stClean">-$3,758</strong></div><div class="ln"><span>Airbnb's fee</span><strong id="stAir">-$3,490</strong></div><div class="ln"><span>Utilities and internet</span><strong id="stUt">-$1,342</strong></div><div class="ln"><span>Supplies and repairs</span><strong id="stSup">-$1,342</strong></div><div class="ln"><span>Manager</span><strong id="stMg">$0</strong></div><div class="ln sum"><span>Kept before the home's bills</span><strong id="stBefore">$16,911</strong></div><div class="ln"><span>HOA fee</span><strong id="stHoa">-$6,900</strong></div><div class="ln"><span>Property tax</span><strong id="stTx">-$4,272</strong></div><div class="ln"><span>Insurance and permit</span><strong id="stIn">-$620</strong></div><div class="big"><span>You keep a year<button type="button" class="q" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="stKeptQ" aria-label="What you keep a year means">?</button></span><strong id="stKept">$5,119</strong></div><p class="tip" id="stKeptQ">The rate and nights are town averages, so 