="wrap" style="text-align:center;max-width:720px;margin:0 auto"><h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--ivory);margin-bottom:1rem">Before you offer on a Garden City home, we check four things.</h2><p style="color:rgba(244,239,232,.75);line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:1.6rem">Which county it is in, what its HOA or condo papers say about renting, its flood zone and the building's flood policy, and its tax bill as a rental or as your main home.</p><a class="btn btn-brass btn-lg" href="/contact/?place=Garden%20City">Ask about a Garden City home</a></div></section></main>
